#: ../../source/2-how_to/4-controllers/12-ros2_parameters.md:33
#: 5877ca7d0e6a49c8a4e49d1b7d6bd59a
msgid ""
"Most hardware `<param>` values do **not** appear on `ros2 param list` — "
"they are baked into `/robot_description` when xacro runs. Some public "
"driver-layer plugins also `declare_parameter` the same names as node "
"params (ARX, HighTorque, Marvin, some 灵巧手); those rows are marked "
"**Runtime** on [Driver layer "
"parameters](../../4-reference/hardware/4-ros2_parameters.md). Confirm the"
" plugin with `ros2 control list_hardware_interfaces` and the xacro under "
"`xacro/ros2_control/`."
msgstr ""
"大多数硬件 `<param>` **不会**出现在 `ros2 param list` 上 — xacro 运行时已写入 `/robot_description`。部分公开驱动层插件也会把同名项 "
"`declare_parameter` 成节点参数（ARX、HighTorque、Marvin、部分灵巧手）；这些行在 [驱动层参数](../../4-reference/hardware/4-ros2_parameters.md) "
"标为 **运行时**。用 `ros2 control list_hardware_interfaces` 以及 `xacro/ros2_control/` "
"下的 xacro 核对插件。"

