"A YAML value is always applied when the controller or driver-layer plugin"
" **starts**. Whether `ros2 param set` later changes behavior uses the "
"same tags as the package READMEs:"
msgstr ""
"YAML 中的值在控制器或驱动层插件**启动**时总会生效。之后 `ros2 param set` 会不会改行为，使用与包 README "
"相同的标记："

