#: ../../source/2-how_to/4-controllers/12-ros2_parameters.md:26
#: f92d41d97c0c450ca0335ab559481762
msgid ""
"`ros2 param set` is picked up **without** reloading. These controllers "
"have no generic `add_on_set_parameters_callback` for the documented keys."
" Home / MoveJ / waist duration / MoveL are re-read with `get_parameter` "
"on the **next** matching state enter or command."
msgstr ""
"`ros2 param set` **无需**重新加载即可被拾取。这些控制器对已文档化的键没有通用的 "
"`add_on_set_parameters_callback`。Home / MoveJ / 腰部 duration / MoveL "
"在**下一次**进入匹配状态或收到匹配命令时用 `get_parameter` 重读。"

#: ../../source/2-how_to/4-controllers/12-ros2_parameters.md:26
#: 9a921f40925d44a78f834d48a30eb6f5
msgid "**Startup only**"
msgstr "**仅启动**"

